Over multi‑year simulations, GMSS produces coupled evolution across domains:

Geomechanical: Basin compaction, uplift, stress redistribution.

Fluid Flow: Reorganization of water and methane pathways.

Fracture Dynamics: Growth and connectivity of fracture networks.

Biogeochemistry: Microbial metabolism alters mineralogy and porosity.

Cosmic Forcing: Stellar motion modulates stress fields.

Cryptographic Governance: All transitions are validated and immutable.

